# ===== Todolist ==========
# 2026-10-06 修正：原规则 `*todo*.md` 会匹配任意层级，把
# docs/维护/2026-07-22-missing-initial-units-todo.md 这类**项目文档**
# 一并排除，导致它从未被提交、clone 的人看不到。
# 收窄为「仅忽略仓库根目录的随手 todo」：
/*todo*.md
todolist
# docs/ 下的 todo 属于项目正式记录，正常纳入版本控制。
# 依据：docs/维护/README.md ——「待办类文档必须标明是否仍未完成」
!docs/**/*todo*.md
# ===== Node.js dependencies for tools/ (jsdom, playwright) =====
tools/node_modules/
tools/package-lock.json

# ===== Map previews (rendered PNGs) — regenerate with =====
# `python -m app.tools.render_map_preview --all`
# The PNGs are deliberately not tracked; only the index.html stays.
map_previews/*.png

# ===== Reference projects (downloaded separately into ref/) =====
# Open-source战棋参考项目从 GitHub clone 下来的副本，
# 不进版本控制。本地手动跑 `cd ref/ && git clone <url>` 即可。
# README 索引和 .bat 快捷启动脚本仍进版本控制。
ref/
# But keep the following files in version control:
!ref/README.md
!ref/*.bat
!ref/*.md
godot-client/godot-ref/
.git-rewrite/

# ===========参考i=========
docs/参考/fe_image

# ===== Local worktrees =====
.worktrees/

# ===== Growth-redesign dev scratch =====
# One-shot scripts used during the 2026-08-09 growth-redesign implementation.
# Kept locally for reference; not part of the codebase. Delete once their
# data has been re-applied to the registry (already done in the matching
# commit on feat/commander-sound-polish).
_older_tmp
_tmp_apply_growth.py
_tmp_apply_hero_growth.py

# ===== Growth chart review artifacts =====
# PNG renders produced by `python -m tools.growth_charts --policy=...`
# for visual review of the per-class / per-hero growth curves. The chart
# tool is re-runnable; PNGs aren't tracked.
tools/growth_charts_v1_rolled/
tools/growth_charts_combat_pacing_v3/
tools/growth_charts_dual_track_expected/
tools/growth_charts_dual_track_v2_uplifted/
tools/growth_charts_v2_balanced/

